  "answer_text": "Here is an overview of what **FedEx.com** offers, based on the latest information:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\ude9a FedEx \u2013 Tracking, Shipping & More\n\n**\ud83c\udf10 Main Website:** [www.fedex.com](https://www.fedex.com/en-us/home.html)\n\nYou can use FedEx.com to **log in to your FedEx account**, get your **tracking status**, find a **FedEx location near you**, learn more about how to become a better shipper, get online print offers, or get inspiration for your small business needs.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udce6 FedEx Home Delivery\nFedEx offers fast, reliable, on-time residential shipping services. With **FedEx Home Delivery**, you can get day-definite home delivery \u2014 even on **evenings and Saturdays**.\n\n- FedEx Home Delivery delivers packages **150 lbs. or less** to residences **every day of the week**.\n- FedEx Home Delivery delivers within **1\u20135 days**, every day of the week, including Saturday and Sunday (excluding Hawaii and Alaska).\n- For shipments to/from Alaska and Hawaii, FedEx Home Delivery delivers within **3\u20137 days**.\n- FedEx Home Delivery **cannot deliver to P.O. boxes** at this time.\n\n---\n\n### \u2708\ufe0f FedEx Express Services\nExpedited shipping is a fast method for sending priority shipments that must reach their destination by a specific deadline. This service accommodates a range of items, from **individual envelopes and packages to palletized freight**.\n\nSome available Express services include:\n- **FedEx Overnight** for next-day delivery, **FedEx 2Day\u00ae** for cost-effective 2-day delivery, **FedEx Express Saver\u00ae** for 3-day delivery, and **FedEx International Priority\u00ae** for international delivery in 1\u20133 days.\n- When next-day delivery isn't fast enough, consider **FedEx SameDay\u00ae**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf0d International Shipping\nFedEx lets you expand your reach to **130+ countries and territories**. FedEx Global Air Freight gives you the support, visibility, and expertise you need to cross borders with confidence.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcb0 Rewards & Savings\nWhen you join **FedEx Rewards**, the extras start immediately \u2014 you'll get a **$10 gift card** for your first eligible shipment. Open a FedEx account to get started.\n\nWith **FedEx One Rate\u00ae**, you get flat-rate, **2-day shipping** for packages up to **50 lbs**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f Vacation Hold\nHeaded out for vacation? Don't let packages collect on your porch. Place a **vacation hold** with **FedEx Delivery Manager\u00ae** for up to **14 days \u2014 for free!**\n\n---\n\nYou can visit FedEx directly at **[fedex.com](https://www.fedex.com/en-us/home.html)** to track packages, ship, find locations, and manage your account. Is there anything specific you'd like help with regarding FedEx services?",
